
  Galileo Alpine — bankonOS on Alpine, for openBDK
  Running from RAM (diskless). Nothing is kept unless you `lbu commit`.

    bankon-ram status        RAM, zram, tmpfs, what is using memory
    bankon-ram net           network + Tor checks (sends nothing)
    bankon-ram clock         skew vs chronos, mindX's time oracle (Tor needs a correct clock)
    bankon-amnesia status    is this session amnesic?
    bankon-share id|seed|get share by THOT / CID: BitTorrent, IPFS, Tor, Arweave (verified)
    openbdk-bootstrap USER   prepare for openbdk/builder (bash, doas, apk cache)
    apk add bitcoin bitcoin-cli                               Bitcoin Core, offline from the ISO
    bash /opt/bankonme/builds/alpine/chomsky.build conf       bitcoin.conf + read-only AION RPC user
    bash /opt/bankonme/builds/alpine/chomsky.build foundry    Foundry (musl, needs network)

